<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIAN RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIAN RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Australian premiership</p>
<p>rugby league matches played at the weekend.</p>
<p>Played Sunday:</p>
<p> Manly		 26  Gold Coast	 26</p>
<p>Newcastle v South Sydney postponed due to bad weather</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p> South Queensland  22  North Sydney     36</p>
<p> Parramatta	  25  Balmain	    14</p>
<p> Illawarra	    2  Western Suburbs   6</p>
<p>Played Friday:</p>
<p> Sydney City	 22  St George	   8</p>
<p>Premiership standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, points for, points against, total points):</p>
<p> Manly		 10    7    2    1   230   167    16</p>
<p> Sydney City	 10    7    0    3   236   152    14</p>
<p> North Sydney	10    6    1    3   239   141    13</p>
<p> Newcastle	    9    6    0    3   192   128    12</p>
<p> Illawarra	   10    4    2    4   190   167    10</p>
<p> St George	   10    5    0    5   170   185    10</p>
<p> Parramatta	  10    5    0    5   158   177    10</p>
<p> Gold Coast	  10    4    1    5   208   212     9</p>
<p> Balmain	     10    4    0    6   141   156     8</p>
<p> Western Suburbs   10    4    0    6   114   155     8</p>
<p> South Sydney	 9    3    0    6   137   258     6</p>
<p> South Queensland  10    1    0    9   149   266     2</p>
